course: dictionary
lesson: 9148
title: Hidden danger in context
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A word can tell you a lot even when you only know part of its meaning. Look at the clues around it. In «many by snipers (hidden shooters)», the words hidden and shooters point to someone who shoots from a hiding place.
explain: Check your guess by swapping in your meaning. «Mia's squad kept losing because all four of them wanted to be the sniper and nobody wanted to heal anyone.» In a game, a sniper is a player who shoots from far away. The line also suggests that healing is a different job in the team.
explain: Some words have a related verb. To snipe means to shoot from hiding, and it can also mean to make sneaky, unkind comments. Only the context tells you which meaning the author means.
fact: A sniper is a soldier or gunman who shoots at people from a hidden place, often far away, with a special rifle.
fact: In video games, a sniper is a player or character who shoots from far away. "Sniper" can also mean the long-range rifle itself.
fact: Phrases you may meet are «sniper fire», «sniper rifle», «shot by a sniper» and «sniper's nest».
fact: «Snipe» is the related verb: it means to shoot from hiding, or to make sneaky, mean comments.
fact: In February 2014, many of the protesters killed on the Maidan in Ukraine were shot by snipers, and the dead are honoured as the «Heavenly Hundred».
exercise: «Mia's squad kept losing because all four of them wanted to be the sniper.» In this game, what is a sniper? | Cooking a big dinner | A player who heals the team | A kind of team name | *A player who shoots from far away
exercise: In «many by snipers (hidden shooters)», which words tell you what a sniper does? | Heavenly Hundred | *hidden shooters | protesters | February
exercise: Max says his sister was sniping at him all through dinner. What might sniping mean here? | Running fast to school | Cooking a big dinner | *Making sneaky, unkind comments | Singing very loudly
test: «The sniper's nest was hidden in the trees.» What does sniper's nest suggest? | A place to hold a party | A soft bed for sleeping | *A hidden place for shooting from far away | A bird's home in a tall tree
test: In a game, what can the word sniper mean? | A type of sandwich | A quiet kind of bird | *A long-range rifle or the player who uses it | A teacher who gives tests
exam: Read «sniper fire» and «shot by a sniper». What do the words around sniper tell you? | It is a friendly helper | It is a type of fruit | *It is a hidden shooter who fires from far away | It means very happy
